  "body": "**document base URL** was defined as an [absolute URL](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#absolute-url-string) which is a string. But it is used, and algorithmically defined, as a [URL record](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url). This PR changes the defined type of **document base URL** to [URL record](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url).\n\nFixes #7297\n\nAlthough the change is theoretically normative (it modifies the defined type of a term) I think it can be considered as editorial. It does not require changes to implementations.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7298/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 5, 2021, 9:09 AM UTC (601d839)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7298/4aeec51...601d839/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 5, 2021, 9:09 AM UTC (601d839)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7298/urls-and-fetching.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 5, 2021, 9:09 AM UTC (601d839)\">/urls-and-fetching.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7298/4aeec51...601d839/urls-and-fetching.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 5, 2021, 9:09 AM UTC (601d839)\">diff</a> )",
